DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTSTAMP:20261030T165658Z
UID:1a213b2f5ab356ec8575bcaca10e@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Before she was hit-maker Carole King — she was Carole Klein
 \, a spunky\, young songwriter from Brooklyn with a unique voice. From the
